- Hydraulic Seal Compound: ${sealSelect.options[sealSelect.selectedIndex].text}
- Hydraulic Fluid Class: ${fluidSelect.options[fluidSelect.selectedIndex].text}
- Enclosure & Safety Guarding: ${enclosureSelect.options[enclosureSelect.selectedIndex].text}
- Platen Operating Temperature: ${tempSlider.value}°C (${Math.round(tempSlider.value * 1.8 + 32)}°F)
- Hydraulic System Pressure: ${pressureSlider.value} PSI
- Press Stroke Cycle Rate: ${cycleSlider.value} strokes/min
- Power Unit Reservoir Temp: ${resTempSlider.value}°C (${Math.round(resTempSlider.value * 1.8 + 32)}°F)

[CALCULATED FORENSIC DIAGNOSTICS]
- Actual Clamping Force: ${clampingForceOut.textContent} (${clampingKnOut.textContent})
- Rod Gland Thermal Soak: ${glandTempOut.textContent} (${glandFOut.textContent})
- Seal Hardness & Compression: ${sealHardnessOut.textContent} | ${compressionSetOut.textContent}
- Estimated Seal Lifetime: ${sealLifeOut.textContent} (${sealStrokesOut.textContent})
- Rupture Orifice Jet Velocity: ${jetVelocityOut.textContent} (${jetMachOut.textContent})
- Aerosol Droplet Sauter Mean: ${dropletSizeOut.textContent} (${weberOut.textContent})
- Platen Contact Flash Fire Risk: ${flashFireOut.textContent} (${flashMarginOut.textContent})
- Safety Compliance Rating: ${statusSummaryOut.textContent} [${isoPlOut.textContent}]

[EXPERT MECHANISMS & DIRECTIVES]
- Primary Failure Mode:
  ${primaryRiskText.textContent.trim()}
- Thermodynamic & Tribological Breakdown:
  ${mechanismsText.textContent.trim()}
- Engineering Directives & Safeguards:
  ${mitigationText.textContent.trim()}

Regulatory Frameworks: ASME B15.1, NFPA 79 § 4.3/15.2, NFPA 30, OSHA 29 CFR § 1910.212, ISO 13849-1, FDA 21 CFR § 178.3570.
